1. GRANT

Omega6.0 Waste Network holds a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide licence to
use, modify, host and commercially exploit this software, together with the
assigned copyright in the software as delivered. Licensee modifications are
owned by the licensee and transfer with the software.

2. TRANSFER

This licence is TRANSFERABLE without notice to or consent from FieldOps
Software Ltd. It may be assigned outright, sublicensed, or included in the
sale of a business unit.

3. SOURCE CODE ESCROW

Source code for the software is held in escrow (agreement FOS-ESC-2211).
The escrow agreement transfers with the licence. An acquirer should notify
the escrow agent of the change of beneficiary to preserve release rights on
a vendor-insolvency trigger.

Because the full source is delivered directly under this licence, the escrow
is a continuity safeguard for the ORIGINAL vendor's build artefacts and
toolchain, not the only route to the code.

4. FIELD OF USE — UNRESTRICTED

FieldOps sells this product into field service, logistics, utilities and
waste management. This licence carries NO field-of-use restriction: the
software may be deployed in any vertical.

Note for a prospective acquirer: the software's domain-neutral vocabulary
(`job_ref` rather than any domain-specific identifier) is deliberate and
preserves that generality. Narrowing it to one vertical would reduce the
asset's resale value.

5. NO SUPPORT AGREEMENT ATTACHED

No maintenance or support agreement was included in the asset purchase.
The software transfers as-is. FieldOps Software Ltd. has no ongoing
obligation to the licensee or to any subsequent acquirer.

6. WARRANTY

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. THE LIABILITY OF FIELDOPS SOFTWARE LTD. AND OF OMEGA6.0 WASTE
NETWORK IS LIMITED TO THE CONSIDERATION PAID UNDER THE APPLICABLE PURCHASE
AGREEMENT.

